WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.120
Fernwood: the oldest green in all the
Everwild.

2
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.968
Verdalis, the Bloom Wyrm, sleeps curled
around the Sleeping Stone.

3
00:00:10.008 --> 00:00:12.895
But violet petals fall among the ferns
now,

4
00:00:12.935 --> 00:00:15.957
and the little sprouts have turned to
thorns.

5
00:00:15.997 --> 00:00:21.817
The Rootgate always opens on Fernwood
first. Mind the thorns.

